WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.055 --> 00:00:05.758
Roxy went back to her friends. "I just remembered," she said.

2
00:00:05.759 --> 00:00:10.049
"It's, uh, my aunt's birthday. I should call her."

3
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.996
Roxy hurried away.

4
00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:15.803
Terrell caught up to her.

5
00:00:15.804 --> 00:00:19.696
"Are you going to find the Tattle Twins?" he asked.

6
00:00:19.697 --> 00:00:21.290
Roxy shook her head.

7
00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:23.604
"There's an emergency at Police Headquarters.

8
00:00:23.605 --> 00:00:28.649
I'll be back soon."

9
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.689
Terrell went back to his seat.

10
00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:33.380
"Rocket Girl was framed," he said.

11
00:00:33.381 --> 00:00:35.651
Mara and Jack nodded.

12
00:00:35.652 --> 00:00:37.715
Terrell tapped his chin.

13
00:00:37.716 --> 00:00:40.473
"Rocket Girl always helps other people.

14
00:00:40.474 --> 00:00:44.809
I wish we could help her."

15
00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.753
*** Roxy arrived at Police

16
00:00:47.754 --> 00:00:52.820
Headquarters. Several police officers were waiting for

17
00:00:52.821 --> 00:00:55.383
her. "Where's the emergency?" Roxy

18
00:00:55.384 --> 00:00:58.308
asked. An officer slapped handcuffs on

19
00:00:58.309 --> 00:01:02.804
Roxy. "You're under arrest, Rocket

20
00:01:02.805 --> 00:01:06.222
Girl." "What?" Roxy

21
00:01:06.223 --> 00:01:09.232
cried. The officer led Roxy toward the jail

22
00:01:09.233 --> 00:01:11.534
cells. Roxy looked down at the

23
00:01:11.535 --> 00:01:14.701
handcuffs. "I could break these and escape," she

24
00:01:14.702 --> 00:01:17.445
thought. She looked back at all the police

25
00:01:17.446 --> 00:01:19.848
officers. "But I don't want anyone to get

26
00:01:19.849 --> 00:01:22.093
hurt." The officer opened a jail

27
00:01:22.094 --> 00:01:24.397
cell. Detective Smith was sitting

28
00:01:24.398 --> 00:01:26.490
inside. He looked

29
00:01:26.491 --> 00:01:28.110
annoyed. Roxy went

30
00:01:28.111 --> 00:01:30.346
in. The officer took off the

31
00:01:30.347 --> 00:01:35.923
handcuffs. Then she slammed the door

32
00:01:35.924 --> 00:01:37.898
shut. "Detective," Roxy

33
00:01:37.899 --> 00:01:40.106
said. "I don't like your new

34
00:01:40.107 --> 00:01:42.320
office." Detective Smith rolled his

35
00:01:42.321 --> 00:01:45.290
eyes. "Very funny, Rocket Girl."

36
00:01:45.291 --> 00:01:50.597
Roxy sighed. "Mayor Bloom tricked me into coming here.

37
00:01:50.598 --> 00:01:53.734
He obviously thinks we blew up that car.

38
00:01:53.735 --> 00:01:56.545
But we didn't. Remember?"

39
00:01:56.546 --> 00:01:58.178
Detective Smith nodded.

40
00:01:58.179 --> 00:02:01.516
"I remember. It was just last week.

41
00:02:01.517 --> 00:02:04.850
Two cars crashed, and one caught on fire.

42
00:02:04.851 --> 00:02:07.742
You put the fire out with your super breath.

43
00:02:07.743 --> 00:02:11.747
You also saved the driver."

44
00:02:11.748 --> 00:02:14.046
Roxy groaned.

45
00:02:14.047 --> 00:02:16.575
"What are we going to do, Detective?

46
00:02:16.576 --> 00:02:19.513
We have to prove that we're innocent."

47
00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:21.417
Just then they heard someone talking.

48
00:02:21.418 --> 00:02:25.009
"We need to send police to 100 West Street," an officer said.

49
00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:26.874
"Some Cooltubers are in trouble.

50
00:02:26.875 --> 00:02:29.087
They're called the Tattle Twins."

51
00:02:29.088 --> 00:02:31.546
"Okay," another officer said.

52
00:02:31.547 --> 00:02:35.479
"Hmm," Roxy said. "I wonder what's wrong."

53
00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:38.296
Suddenly she had an idea.

54
00:02:38.297 --> 00:02:41.795
"I should go and help the Tattle Twins, Detective.

55
00:02:41.796 --> 00:02:44.804
Then I can find out why they're framing me."

56
00:02:44.805 --> 00:02:47.565
"And me!" Detective Smith said.

57
00:02:47.566 --> 00:02:51.275
"Right," Roxy said.

58
00:02:51.276 --> 00:02:53.986
"Is it okay if I break out of here?"

59
00:02:53.987 --> 00:02:57.626
Detective Smith nodded. "Good luck, Rocket Girl."

60
00:02:57.627 --> 00:03:01.865
Boom! Roxy pounded through the wall and flew off.

61
00:03:01.866 --> 00:03:04.377
A police car zoomed toward West Street.

62
00:03:04.378 --> 00:03:06.552
Roxy shot past the car.

63
00:03:06.553 --> 00:03:10.274
A moment later she burst into an apartment.

64
00:03:10.275 --> 00:03:13.093
The Tattle Twins stood in front of a safe.

65
00:03:13.094 --> 00:03:21.844
"Yay!" Pam said. "Rocket Girl is here!"

